type":3,"image":"","sort":15,"isFeatured":true,"url":"637569-bernadette-heerwagen","peopleType":"Actor","personName":"Bernadette Heerwagen","personImgURL":""},{"id":65907284,"name":"","peopleId":8152505,"movieId":"152460","type":2,"image":"","sort":1,"isFeatured":true,"url":"8152505-enid-blyton","peopleType":"Writer","personName":"Enid Blyton","personImgURL":""},{"id":65907287,"name":"","peopleId":8244697,"movieId":"152460","type":2,"image":"","sort":2,"isFeatured":true,"url":"8244697-simon-hauschild","peopleType":"Writer","personName":"Simon Hauschild","personImgURL":""},{"id":65907290,"name":"","peopleId":8244698,"movieId":"152460","type":2,"image":"","sort":3,"isFeatured":true,"url":"8244698-mike-marzuk","peopleType":"Writer","personName":"Mike Marzuk","personImgURL":""},{"id":65907293,"name":"","peopleId":8244698,"movieId":"152460","type":1,"image":"","sort":1,"isFeatured":true,"url":"8244698-mike-marzuk","peopleType":"Director","personName":"Mike Marzuk","personImgURL":""},{"id":65907296,"name":"","peopleId":8244699,"movieId":"152460","type":7,"image":"","sort":1,"isFeatured":true,"url":"8244699-ewa-karlstrom","peopleType":"Producer","personName":"Ewa Karlström","personImgURL":""},{"id":65907299,"name":"","peopleId":8231584,"movieId":"152460","type":7,"image":"","sort":2,"isFeatured":true,"url":"8231584-martin-moszkowicz","peopleType":"Producer","personName":"Martin Moszkowicz","personImgURL":""},{"id":65907302,"name":"","peopleId":8244700,"movieId":"152460","type":7,"image":"","sort":3,"isFeatured":true,"url":"8244700-bernd-schiller","peopleType":"Producer","personName":"Bernd Schiller","personImgURL":""},{"id":65907305,"name":"","peopleId":8244701,"movieId":"152460","type":7,"image":"","sort":4,"isFeatured":true,"url":"8244701-andreas-ulmke-smeaton","peopleType":"Producer","personName":"Andreas Ulmke-Smeaton","personImgURL":""},{"id":65907308,"name":"","peopleId":8244702,"movieId":"152460","type":7,"image":"","sort":5,"isFeatured":true,"url":"8244702-clifford-werber","peopleType":"Producer","personName":"Clifford Werber","personImgURL":""},{"id":65907311,"name":"","peopleId":8244703,"movieId":"152460","type":7,"image":"","sort":6,"isFeatured":true,"url":"8244703-ole-wilken","peopleType":"Producer","personName":"Ole Wilken","personImgURL":""}],"budget":"0.00","boxOffice":"3273025.00","originalCountry":"deu","originalLanguage":"deu","lists":[],"translations":{"nameTranslations":[{"name":"Fünf Freunde und das Tal der Dinosaurier","language":"deu","IsPrimary":true},{"name":"De 5 i dinosaurernes dal","language":"dan","IsPrimary":false},{"name":"Le Club des Cinq et la vallée des dinosaures","language":"fra","IsPrimary":false},{"name":"I magnifici cinque - La valle dei dinosauri","language":"ita","IsPrimary":false},{"name":"Los cinco y el valle de los dinosaurios","language":"spa","IsPrimary":false},{"name":"The Famous Five and the Valley of Dinosaurs","language":"eng","IsPrimary":false}],"overviewTranslations":[{"overview":"Die fünf Freunde George, Julian, Dick, Anne und Timmy der Hund, die sonst in der freien Zeit spannende Kriminalfälle lösen, müssen mit ihrer Tante Fanny zur Hochzeitsfeier eines Cousins fahren. Ein Glück, dass ein Motorschaden sie zu einem unfreiwilligen Zwischenstopp in einer Kleinstadt zwingt. Zur großen Freude der Fünf soll am Tag darauf im Naturkundemuseum des Ortes der Knochen einer bis dato unbekannten Dinosaurierart präsentiert werden. Während der Ausstellung lernen sie den kauzigen Marty Bach kennen, der behauptet, sein verstorbener Vater habe einst ein vollständig erhaltenes Dinosaurierskelett entdeckt. Natürlich werden die Nachwuchsdetektive hellhörig – und als ihrem neuen Bekannten ein Foto gestohlen wird, auf dessen Rückseite ein Zahlencode notiert war, übernehmen die Fünf den Fall und machen sich auf die Suche nach dem legendären „Tal der Dinosaurier“.","language":"deu","IsPrimary":true},{"overview":"De 5 og Tante Fanny er på vej til fest, da hendes bil bryder sammen og tvinger dem til at gøre holdt i en lille by. For at få tiden til at gå, besøger de det lokale naturhistoriske museum, hvor nogle nyopdagede dinosaurknogler præsenteres. Her møder de Marty, der fortæller, at hans afdøde far angiveligt fandt et komplet dinosaurskelet og lavede et kort over, hvor det er gemt. Nu er kortet desværre blevet stjålet. De 5 kan ikke lade et godt mysterium gå forbi, så de sætter deres egen undersøgelse i gang. Men deres mission for at finde skelettet bliver hurtigt til et kapløb med tiden, da tyvene er lige i hælene på dem.","language":"dan","IsPrimary":false},{"overview":"Le Club des Cinq va tomber sur un os ... de dinosaure ! Vêtus de leur tenue d’explorateur, Claude, François, Mick, Annie et leur fidèle chien Dagobert partent à la recherche d’une carte dérobée à un ami paléontologue qui permet d'accéder à la légendaire vallée des dinosaures. Mais pour ramener des fossiles et devenir les rois du Jurassique, nos jeunes héros vont devoir affronter de véritables pilleurs de trésors.","language":"fra","IsPrimary":false},{"overview":"Sono arrivate le vacanze estive e gli amici George, Julian, Dick, Anne e Timmy il cane, che nel tempo libero risolvono eccitanti casi criminali, devono prendere parte a un matrimonio. Un guasto al loro veicolo li costringe però a fare una sosta non prevista in una piccola cittadina, dove in una mostra al Museo di Storia Naturale è possibile ammirare le ossa di una specie sconosciuta di dinosauro. Durante la mostra, hanno modo di fare la conoscenza dell'irritabile Marty Bach, che sostiene che suo padre, oramai defunto, aveva trovato lo scheletro di un dinosauro ben conservato. Il caso e parecchi indizi attirano così la loro attenzione spingendoli a indagare.","language":"ita","IsPrimary":false},{"overview":"Durante las vacaciones de verano, Los cinco conocen a Marty Bach, un joven de aspecto extraño que afirma que su difunto padre descubrió un esqueleto de dinosaurio completamente intacto, pero le han robado el código que revela las coordenadas del legendario 'Valle de los dinosaurios'. Los cinco deben encontrar ese esqueleto de dinosaurio, de lo contrario, los huesos se perderán para siempre.","language":"spa","IsPrimary":false},{"overview":"En route to a party they are not keen on attending, the Famous Five are almost relieved when Aunt Fanny's car breaks down, stranding them in a small town. To pass the time, they visit the local natural history museum, where some newly-discovered dinosaur bones are being unveiled. Here they meet Marty, who tells them that his father, long dead, supposedly found a complete dinosaur skeleton and made a map of its whereabouts. Unfortunately the map has been stolen. Unable to let a good mystery go unsolved, George, Julian, Dick, Anne and Timmy, join a guided hike through the Valley of Dinosaurs. But their fact-finding mission soon turns into a race to find the dinosaur when they suspect that the thief is one of the group.","language":"eng","IsPrimary":false}]},"contentRatings":[{"id":307,"name":"7","country":"dnk","description":"Not recommended for children under 7","contentType":"movie","order":0,"fullname":"7"}],"companies":{"studio":[],"network":[],"production":[],"distributor":[],"special_effects":[]},"production_countries":[{"id":204571,"country":"deu","name":"Germany"}],"inspirations":[],"spoken_languages":"[deu]","first_release":{"country":"esp","date":"2018-03-15"}}